            <h3 class="me-auto underline-heading mb-4 text-black">Issuers</h3>
            
            <div class="d-flex flex-column flex-row mb-4">
                <img src="https://informinvestor.cmda.gov.mv/storage/uploads/K5oBLkYG/c/bi441ogw-preview.jpg" alt="" width="89px" class="mb-3 w-25">
                <h3 class="fw-bolder">Amana Takaful Maldives</h3>
            </div>
            <p class="text-gray-700 mb-5">
            <div class="page-blocks">
                                                                        <div class="page-block header-block mb-4">
    <h1 class="section-title mb-0">The only fully fledged Takaful Operator in Maldives</h1>
</div>
                                                        <div class="page-block paragraph-block mb-4">
    <div class="text-justify">
    Amana Takaful (Maldives) PLC (ATM) opened up its doors for business in 2003 as the pioneers of Islamic Finance and the only Takaful Operator in the Insurance domain. ATM’s remarkable journey is underpinned to its robust culture, resilience to changes and digital transformation. The bountiful journey is also attributed to its steadfastness to the divine principles of Shari’ah providing total Takaful solutions.
    </div>
</div>
                            </div>

            </p>


            
