                        <h4 class="text-primary mb-2 text-center text-lg-start">TYEAB AKBARALLY</h4>
                        
                        <h6 class="text-secondary fw-normal text-center text-lg-start" id="designation">CHAIRMAN</h6>

















                    

                            <p class="text-gray-500">
                                                                                                                                        <div class="page-block paragraph-block mb-4">
    <div class="text-justify">
    Mr. Tyeab Akbarally is the Chairman of the Company. He has been appointed to the Board since its inception. He is also the Managing Director of Akbar Brothers Ltd., the largest tea exporter in Sri Lanka. Mr. Akbarally’s business interest extends to many sectors of the economy including Pharmaceutical Trade, Hydro, Wind and Solar Power and Commodity Trading. He is also on the Board of several companies in the Akbar Brothers Group and Sunshine Holdings Ltd.
    </div>
</div>
                                                            </p>

                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
