                            <p class="text-gray-500">
                                                                                                                                        <div class="page-block paragraph-block mb-4">
    <div class="text-justify">
    Prof.
Dr. Aishath Muneeza has been appointed as an Independent Director to the Board
effective from 22nd May 2024.
    </div>
</div>
                                                                                                        <div class="page-block paragraph-block mb-4">
    <div class="text-justify">
    Prof. Dr. Aishath
Muneeza, a renowned figure in Islamic Finance, has held prestigious positions
including the first female Deputy Minister of Islamic Affairs and Finance in
Maldives. She has significantly contributed to the development of Islamic
Finance, pioneering Shari’ah compliant microfinance, structuring corporate
sukuks, and drafting legal frameworks. Prof. Dr. Muneeza, an author of over 300
publications and recipient of numerous awards, serves as a Senior Islamic
Finance Advisor for UNFPA, Malaysia, Professor at INCEIF University, and holds
several advisory roles globally.
    </div>
</div>
                                                            </p>

