                            <p class="text-gray-500">
                                                                                                                                        <div class="page-block paragraph-block mb-4">
    <div class="text-justify">
    Mr.
Mohamed Siraj Nizam has been appointed as an Executive Director to the Board
effective from 22nd May 2024.
    </div>
</div>
                                                                                                        <div class="page-block paragraph-block mb-4">
    <div class="text-justify">
    Mr. Siraj Nizam, joined
Amana Takaful Group in 2002, and was seconded to Maldives in 2013. He has over
20 years of experience in Accounting, Finance as well as Treasury and he has
progressed through various positions during this period. He holds a CIMA Advance
Diploma in MA, UK and holds an Award in Financial Planning with CII UK.
    </div>
</div>
                                                            </p>

